{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065934/block/singleImage/3279179/df/1640907807_Zb.jpg?updatedAt=1795687109\"/><figcaption>屯門醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>天水圍發生交通意外。 今日（26日）一輛單車於天水圍屏廈路近羅屋村與一輛中型貨車相撞，騎士倒地受傷昏迷。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，將騎士送往天水圍醫院搶救，其後再轉送至屯門醫院進一步救治，據知傷者仍有呼吸脈搏。警方初步調查後，以涉嫌「危險駕駛導致他人嚴重受傷」拘捕貨車男司機，正</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:53.924778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:58:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:32.278747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:16.458433+00:00","content_hash":"4f48f742f84e0c9ac11b3b7159e3ca37efa573e45cf01f5079ce2efff9822bac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:53.924778+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}